@startuml
title SD07 - Consult Parts Inventory
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "Worker" as User
participant ":InventoryActivity" as View
participant "InventoryController" as Ctrl
participant ":PartsService" as PartsSvc
participant "restdb API" as DB
participant "Mapper" as Mapper
participant "adapter:InventoryAdapter" as Adapter
participant "part:Parts" as Part

activate User

User -> View: asks to consult the inventory

View -> Ctrl: processInventoryInfo(activity, callback)
note right of Ctrl: runs in a background thread, callbacks are posted to the UI thread
Ctrl -> PartsSvc: fetchPartsInfo(activity, "inventory")
PartsSvc -> DB: GET /inventory
DB --> PartsSvc: parts (json)
PartsSvc -> PartsSvc: deserializeParts(jsonArray, "inventory")
PartsSvc --> PartsSvc: partsDTOList
PartsSvc --> Ctrl: partsDTOList

alt no parts found
    Ctrl --> View: onError("No parts were found in the inventory.")
    View --> User: shows error message
else parts found
    Ctrl -> Mapper: storedPartsDTOList2StoredPartsList(partsDTOList)
    Mapper --> Ctrl: partsList
    Ctrl --> View: onSuccess(partsList)
    View --> Adapter**: create(context, partsList)
    View --> User: shows the list of parts (name and associated VIN)

    User -> View: taps a part
    View -> Adapter: getItem(position)
    Adapter --> View: part
    View -> Part: getAssociatedMake(), getAssociatedModel(), getAssociatedYear()
    Part --> View: make, model, year
    View --> User: shows a popup with the make, model and year of the vehicle the part came from

    User -> View: closes the popup
    View --> User: hides the popup
end

@enduml
